  "text": "Hello, this is Peter from the supplier in Rotterdam. I have information about your order. The material does not leave this week, because the truck does not arrive on time. It leaves on Monday, and the delivery is here in ten days. We do not change the price. Please confirm the new deadline by email. Thank you.",
