 },
 {
  "text": "Hi, this is Claire. A quick note about deadlines. In our group, we do not confirm a deadline by phone. We confirm it by email, always. If the supplier does not answer in two days, you call the purchasing team in France. It is a small rule, but it makes a big difference. Thank you.",
